[1.777,"o","\u001b[17A\r\u001b[K\u001b[1B\r\u001b[4;35mRunning it\u001b[0m                                                                  \u001b[1B\r\u001b[K\u001b[1B\r\u001b[48;2;43;48;59m                                                                            \u001b[0m\u001b[1B\r\u001b[1C\u001b[38;2;143;161;179;48;2;43;48;59morbit\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;191;97;106;48;2;43;48;59m --workers\u001b[0m\u001b[38;2;192;197;206;48;2;43;48;59m 8 queue.toml\u001b[0m\u001b[1B\r\u001b[1C\u001b[48;2;43;48;59m                            \u001b[0m\u001b[1B\r\u001b[K\u001b[1B\rThe status page shows each worker, its job and how long it has run. A worker\u001b[1B\rt\r\u001b[2Cat h\r\u001b[7Cs run a job for more than a\r\u001b[35Cminute is marked slow; a job that failed \u001b[1B\r\u001b[2Cree times is\r\u001b[15Clisted with i\r\u001b[29Cs last error.  \r\u001b[45C      \r\u001b[52C     \r\u001b[58C \r\u001b[60C   \r\u001b[64C    \r\u001b[69C      \u001b[1B\r\u001b[K\u001b[1B\r\u001b[4;35mComponents\u001b[0m                                                                  \u001b[1B\r\u001b[K\u001b[1B\rThe terminal side is built from rs-rich-interact components: a picker for   \u001b[1B\rc\r\u001b[2Coosing a queue,\r\u001b[18Ca form for new jobs, a confirmation sheet before anything\u001b[1B\ris cancelled, and\r\u001b[20Cpager for logs. Each\r\u001b[43Cmponen\r\u001b[50C degrad\r\u001b[58Cs\r\u001b[60Cto plain prompts\u001b[1B\rwhen th\r\u001b[8C output is piped,\r\u001b[26Cs\r\u001b[28C orbit works\r\u001b[41Cthe same in CI.   \r\u001b[60C  \r\u001b[63C     \r\u001b[69C       \u001b[1B\r\u001b[7C\u001b[2m1\u001b[0m\r\u001b[10C\u001b[2m7\u001b[0m"]
